{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "said"}, {"text": "إِبْرَٰهِـۧمُ", "translation": "Ibrahim"}, {"text": "رَبِّ", "translation": "My Lord"}, {"text": "أَرِنِى", "translation": "show me"}, {"text": "كَيْفَ", "translation": "how"}, {"text": "تُحْىِ", "translation": "You give life"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ ۖ", "translation": "(to) the dead"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "أَوَلَمْ", "translation": "Have not"}, {"text": "تُؤْمِن ۖ", "translation": "you believed"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "بَلَىٰ", "translation": "Yes"}, {"text": "وَلَـٰكِن", "translation": "[and] but"}, {"text": "لِّيَطْمَئِنَّ", "translation": "to satisfy"}, {"text": "قَلْبِى ۖ", "translation": "my heart"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "فَخُذْ", "translation": "Then take"}, {"text": "أَرْبَعَةًۭ", "translation": "four"}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلطَّيْرِ", "translation": "the birds"}, {"text": "فَصُرْهُنَّ", "translation": "and incline them"}, {"text": "إِلَيْكَ", "translation": "towards you"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "ٱجْعَلْ", "translation": "put"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "on"}, {"text": "كُلِّ", "translation": "each"}, {"text": "جَبَلٍۢ", "translation": "hill"}, {"text": "مِّنْهُنَّ", "translation": "of them"}, {"text": "جُزْءًۭا", "translation": "a portion"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "ٱدْعُهُنَّ", "translation": "call them"}, {"text": "يَأْتِينَكَ", "translation": "they will come to you"}, {"text": "سَعْيًۭا ۚ", "translation": "(in) haste"}, {"text": "وَٱعْلَمْ", "translation": "And know"}, {"text": "أَنَّ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "عَزِيزٌ", "translation": "(is) All-Mighty"}, {"text": "حَكِيمٌۭ", "translation": "All-Wise"}], "sahih": "And [mention] when Abraham said, \"My Lord, show me how You give life to the dead.\" [Allāh] said, \"Have you not believed?\" He said, \"Yes, but [I ask] only that my heart may be satisfied.\" [Allāh] said, \"Take four birds and commit them to yourself.1 Then [after slaughtering them] put on each hill a portion of them; then call them - they will come [flying] to you in haste. And know that Allāh is Exalted in Might and Wise.\""}